% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Bibliography for the COS700 research report.
%
% Every entry here was checked against the publisher, arXiv, or the authors'
% own pages (October 2026). Several proposal references were corrected:
%   * Noever's paper is "Classifier Suites for Insider Threat Detection",
%     arXiv:1901.10948 (not "Machine learning classifiers and the insider
%     threat", arXiv:1908.05895).
%   * Yuan et al.'s "Insider threat detection with deep neural network" is an
%     ICCS 2018 paper (LSTM-CNN), not IEEE TIFS 2021, and does not report a
%     role-normalisation false-positive reduction.
%   * Le and Zincir-Heywood's workflow paper is IEEE SPW 2018 (HMM, SOM,
%     decision trees); it contains no SHAP user study.
%   * Shoderu et al. is ICCWS 2026 with Baror, Modupe and Makura.
%   * The IBM 2024 report gives 287 days to identify and contain a malicious
%     insider breach (258 days for breaches overall), not 197.
%   * "Liu, Xu, Shu and Liu (2019), Computers & Security" could not be found
%     and is not cited.
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

